# Headers for the static files the Worker serves (Workers Static Assets; Vite copies this file
# into dist/, and Cloudflare reads it as rules instead of serving it). Answers from the Worker
# itself (/api/*) set their own headers in src/worker/index.ts. Every other file keeps the
# default Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate. No header is set by two rules.

# Built files have content hashes in their names: never ask again.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# The service worker: always check for a new one.
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
